  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>I</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mi>A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>I</mi></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mi>A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>27</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>On comparing equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p>"
